<title>BRAZIL: Brazil soybean plantings to Dec 5 by state -Safras.</title>
<headline>Brazil soybean plantings to Dec 5 by state -Safras.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian soybean plantings as of Dec 5 by state were as follows, said</p>
<p>consultants Safras e Mercado in its weekly report.</p>
<p> STATE		05/12/96   28/11/96   07/12/95   HISTORICAL</p>
<p>								    AVGE</p>
<p> Rio Grande do Sul     70	   62	   57	     79</p>
<p> Parana		    95	   89	   93	     93</p>
<p> Mato Grosso	     89	   77	   89	     85</p>
<p> Mato Grosso do Sul    85	   70	   81	     84</p>
<p> Goias		     84	   70	   80	     80</p>
<p> Sao Paulo		 94	   80	   90	     87</p>
<p> Minas Gerais	    74	   68	   77	     80</p>
<p> Others		    72	   60	   80	     83</p>
<p> TOTAL BRAZIL	    83	   72	   78	     84</p>
<p>--Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
